cord refuses. More than 500 ids is 54000.", "null_rule": {"means": "no ids: returns no rows"}, "entity": "custom_record", "access": "viewer on each row", "optional": false, "foreign": {"not_a_leak": true, "same_as_invented": true, "note": "another organization''s id and an invented uuid both return 0 rows (measured)"}, "verified": "measured 2026-09-22/23 on the MAIN database from test@test.com''s authenticated seat (a member, not a platform admin), Willow Creek Veterinary Clinic vs High Desert Equine Services, rolled back"}}}'::jsonb
