ed one alike"}, "verified": "measured 2026-09-22/23 on the MAIN database from test@test.com''s authenticated seat (a member, not a platform admin), Willow Creek Veterinary Clinic vs High Desert Equine Services, rolled back"}, "p_token": {"type": "text", "position": 3, "check": "A SHARE-LINK TOKEN, free text, read only by public.share_link_authorizes; it can only ADD a way in for the one id named, never another.", "null_rule": {"means": "no token"}, "optional": true, "sql_default": "NULL", "verified": "static reading 2026-09-23"}}}'::jsonb
